<title>SINGAPORE: Singapore bunker final report and prices- Jan 28.</title>
<headline>Singapore bunker final report and prices- Jan 28.</headline>
<text>
<p>DELIVERED U.S.$/TONNE)  380 CST   180 CST     MDO     GAS OIL</p>
<p> SINGAPORE CARGO	    91/93     98/99	UNQ     188/192</p>
<p> SINGAPORE BUNKER	   97/100   105/107   198/200   205/210</p>
<p>-------- COMMENTS - Bunkers prices dropped late Tuesday after aggressive sellers lowered offers in line with weaker cargo levels, traders said. A major said he sold 180-cst at $108.50 but near close market edged lower with offers at $106-$107 per tonne. Another trader was heard to have sold a MDO parcel at $199 and gasoil at $206.</p>
<p>--Singapore Newsroom (+65-870-3082)</p>
